'''Punchpunchpunch!''' (パンチパンチパンチ！, ''Panchi Panchi Panchi！'', '''Punch Punch Punch!''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (M): Cats' attack power increases by 15%.

